    "headline": "Leidos (NYSE:LDOS) Exceeds Q2 CY2026 Expectations, Stock Soars",
    "summary": "Defense contractor Leidos (NYSE:LDOS) beat Wall Street’s revenue expectations in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 7.2% year on year to $4.56 billion. The company expects the full year’s revenue to be around $18.3 billion, close to analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $3.26 per share was 12.1% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
